  "tier": "told-once",
  "plain": "In 1948 a saucer is said to have come down in Hart Canyon near Aztec, New Mexico, and a local preacher named Solon Brown prayed over the dead beings found inside. Scott Ramsey, who tells the Aztec story on the show, relays Brown's own words when he was asked to pray: \"Well, I'm not Catholic. I'm a Baptist preacher, but I'd be more than happy to say a prayer over him.\""
